WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,160
Look, just don't go into the cooking den.

2
00:00:02,160 --> 00:00:04,660
Thank you, boss. I'll be down in a moment.

3
00:00:04,660 --> 00:00:07,660
Boss, I specially brought Hua Qingxiang here with me

4
00:00:07,660 --> 00:00:09,660
Are you feeling particularly disappointed?

5
00:00:09,660 --> 00:00:11,660
How dare you tease your boss in front of him?

6
00:00:11,660 --> 00:00:14,380
No matter how big or small, you should be punished

7
00:00:14,380 --> 00:00:16,880
Boss, I was wrong

8
00:00:16,880 --> 00:00:19,880
You can punish me however you want, I will listen to you

9
00:00:19,880 --> 00:00:22,640
Be calm, Qingxiang is still upstairs.

10
00:00:22,640 --> 00:00:23,640
What words do people see like?

11
00:00:23,640 --> 00:00:25,140
Boss, you are really timid

12
00:00:25,140 --> 00:00:27,640
I am very satisfied with the new house, it is big and spacious

13
00:00:27,640 --> 00:00:30,140
When you are free someday, come and sit at my place

14
00:00:30,140 --> 00:00:31,640
I dance for you alone

15
00:00:31,640 --> 00:00:34,640
Besides, work is work, don’t engage in such fun in private

16
00:00:34,640 --> 00:00:41,700
Boss, your villa is too luxurious

17
00:00:41,700 --> 00:00:42,700
large swimming pool

18
00:00:42,700 --> 00:00:46,740
It's okay. I usually live alone, so it's a little empty.

19
00:00:46,740 --> 00:00:49,740
Boss, you are usually so busy, so you must make sure your house is cleaned.

20
00:00:49,740 --> 00:00:53,600
Otherwise, I'll clean up for you later

21
00:00:53,600 --> 00:00:57,600
The company has a terminal apartment, so you don’t need to come and ask in person.
